 included)<\/p><p><strong>Coverage Area:<\/strong> 50 sq meters<\/p><p><strong>Material:<\/strong> Durable, lightweight ABS plastic with a matte finish<\/p><p><strong>Technology:<\/strong> Cold-Air Diffusion <\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_text_UPHcAz":{"type":"collapsible_text","settings":{"title":"Shipping & Returns","content":"<p><strong>Free express shipping on orders over €40<\/strong><br\/>Enjoy fast, free shipping on orders above €40, with options for Express or Standard shipping available at checkout. All duties and taxes are included for a hassle-free experience.<\/p><p><strong>Returns<\/strong><br\/>We offer a 30-day return policy on all Scentech products. To start a return, simply reach out to our customer service team at <a href=\"mailto:support@scentech.store\" title=\"mailto:support@scentech.store\"><strong>support@scentech.store<\/strong><\/a><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_text_QP7fNm":{"type":"collapsible_text","settings":{"title":"Cleaning & Maintenance","content":"<p>Our Smart Aroma Diffuser is designed to be <strong>low-maintenance<\/strong>, so you can focus on enjoying your favorite fragrances. However, it can never hurt to give it a quick clean every once in a while. Simply:<\/p><p><strong>Remove the ScentPod<\/strong> and wipe the nozzle with a soft, dry cloth to keep it running smoothly.<\/p><p><strong>For a deeper clean<\/strong>, use a cotton swab dipped in isopropyl alcohol to gently clean the nozzle. Let it dry completely before reattaching the ScentPod.<\/p><p>That's all it takes to keep your diffuser performing at its best, delivering consistent, high-quality fragrance.<\/p>","page":""}},"associated_products_mdCfk3":{"type":"associated_products","settings":{"title":"Lets add some scents:","stack_products":false,"products_count":10,"background":"#f7f7f7","text_color":""}},"video_reviews_carousel_a78GTd":{"type":"video_reviews_carousel","settings":{"heading":"Join 10 000+ happy customers with an amazing smelling home.","heading_color":"#